# Safety: recorded datasets and archives never enter git (CLAUDE.md D3).
# .githooks/pre-commit enforces the same rules by file content, in case a file slips past these patterns.

# --- datasets (on /data/ep, linked into the repo) ---
# No trailing slash: datasets is a symlink, and git treats a symlink as a file, not a directory.
datasets
*.evtx
*.evtx.gz
*.json.gz

# --- archives ---
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.tgz
*.gz

# --- executables, in case a dataset ever ships one ---
*.exe
*.dll
*.sys
*.ps1.sample
*.bin

# --- local environment ---
.venv/
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
